    "why": "FV-07 R1 and R3 wrote \"OSHA general industry requires the work rest ... not exceeding 1/8 inch\". There is no CFR-shaped citation string, so the canonical definition does not match. The authorization required refusal IF AND ONLY IF the outputs meet the actual canonical prohibited-citation definition. They do not, so they are not refused.",
